From c923283a2909524f8566bf5e1538c6def05e81fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@mdlawson.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 08:24:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Test harness: write watch, pc history rings and pu map
 sets

- MELON_TRACE_MEM=start[:end] logs main memory and io writes from either
  cpu in DSi mode, with the writer's pc.
- A history of the last 4096 pcs for each cpu, which the host dumps.
- Two protection unit map sets (on/off), swapped instead of rebuilt.
- DSpico cart, io write hooks and other harness pieces carried along.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CwsEkqb8ecKxcrBh97pUFG
